# In the Blood (ToAU 32). Naja's trigger plays 3113 (progress). Finished with a full bag (fill-inventory): the Imperial
# Gold Piece cannot be given, the completion fails and nothing is set; room again: completed, the Timer set to the
# next Vanadiel day (and a local var named mustZone, which the base Lua never reads: getMustZone reads a char var).
# Naja's trigger again (Sentinels' Honor current): 3120, the Timer in the future.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3113
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau InTheBlood current
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 3113
fill-inventory
finish                                  # no room: the completion fails
free-inventory
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 3113
finish                                  # completed, the Timer set
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # Sentinels' Honor: the Timer in the future
finish-if-event
